<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALY BEAT MOLDOVA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALY BEAT MOLDOVA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TRIESTE, Italy 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy beat Moldova 3-0</p>
<p>in a European group two World Cup qualifier on Saturday</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0).</p>
<p>Scorers: Paolo Maldini 24, Gianfranco Zola 44, Christian</p>
<p>Vieri 49</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
<p>Standings</p>
<p> Italy		  4   4   0   0   8   1  12</p>
<p> England		4   3   0   1   7   2   9</p>
<p> Poland		 2   1   0   1   3   3   3</p>
<p> Georgia		2   0   0   2   0   3   0</p>
<p> Moldova		4   0   0   4   2   11  0</p>
<p>Remaining matches:</p>
<p> April 2   - Poland v Italy</p>
<p>April 30  - England v Georgia</p>
<p>April 30  - Italy v Poland</p>
<p> May 31    - Poland v England</p>
<p> June 7    - Georgia v Moldova</p>
<p> June 14   - Poland v Georgia</p>
<p> Sept 10   - England v Moldova</p>
<p> Sept 10   - Georgia v Italy</p>
<p> Sept 24   - Moldova v Georgia</p>
<p> Oct 7     - Moldova v Poland</p>
<p> Oct  11   - Italy v England</p>
<p> Oct 11    - Georgia v Poland</p>
</text>
